==Trivia==
[[File:TCGP Cover Garden of Smiling Flowers.png|thumb|"Garden of Smiling Flowers" binder cover]]
This card's standard illustration is part of a {{TCG|combined illustration}} along with {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Tangela|4}}, {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Togepi|63}}, and {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Buneary|137}} from the same expansion. Together, these cards form the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Garden of Smiling Flowers" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. A second collection—the "Garden of Smiling Flowers 2" secret mission—was added to the game on June 26, 2025; the completion reward for this is the "Garden of Smiling Flowers" binder cover, showcasing the full illustration.

===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Shaymin}} in its {{form|Shaymin|Land Forme}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Shaymin|33}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*'''Flop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shining Pearl}}.

